{"id": "59723", "title": "勾魂夺魄", "author": "且共从容", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/59/59723.htm", "intro": "勾魂夺魄之美，只引来饿狼无数。\r\n这个美男易求，女子难寻的世界，她的美丽，聪慧只换来无数的情劫。\r\n她自认不过是个普通的女人，从懵懂，到被人所爱，却始终无法敞开心扉，真正抹去那些渐渐浮现的前生记忆。\r\n即使沉鱼落雁勾魂夺魄，又如何，在情劫中欲海重生？", "base": "files/article/html/59/59723", "chapters": [{"title": "1", "file": "8720961.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2", "file": "8720963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "3", "file": "8720967.html", "available": false}, {"title": "4", "file": "8720968.html", "available": false}, {"title": "5", "file": "8720970.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6", "file": "8720971.html", "available": false}, {"title": "完结", "file": "8720974.html", "available": false}]}